<title>JAPAN: Japan July rapeseed imports up 31.2 pct year/year.</title>
<headline>Japan July rapeseed imports up 31.2 pct year/year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's rapeseed imports in July totalled 155,513 tonnes, up 31.2 percent from a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry statistics released on Wednesday. The breakdown was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			July 96	 June 96	July 95</p>
<p> Total rapeseed   155,513	 163,685	118,514</p>
<p>Major suppliers of rapeseed (in tonnes):</p>
<p> Canada	     131,327	 136,123	112,357</p>
<p> Australia	   24,133	  27,012	  6,068</p>
<p>Imports in the first seven months of 1996 were 1,142,832 tonnes, versus 1,061,772 tonnes in the same period of 1995.</p>
</text>
